config BR2_PACKAGE_RK3326_UBOOT
	bool "rk3326-uboot (R36S clone, G80CA)"
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	depends on BR2_HOSTARCH = "x86_64" # Linaro GCC 6.3 binaries
	help
	  Rockchip's legacy U-Boot (2017.09) as christianhaitian's
	  RG351MP-u-boot builds it for the RK3326 handhelds, with the
	  R36S clone's G80CA board and both of its panels (from
	  BobMoss), the panel-ID check, and LightMoss's fallback to the
	  internal eMMC when TF1 holds no system.

	  Produces idbloader.img, uboot.img and trust.img for the raw
	  boot sectors, and uboot.dtb / uboot-panel9.dtb for BOOT.
